  "description": "This one-pot cabbage soup delivers a brothy, flavorful, and satisfying meal in under an hour.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Chopped fresh cilantro leaves and tender stems, for serving; Lime wedges, for serving\n\nOptional substitutions: homemade chicken stock → store-bought low-sodium chicken broth or vegetable broth\n\nNotes: We like the flavor that chicken stock brings to this soup, but if you prefer to keep it vegan, feel free to substitute low-sodium vegetable broth for the chicken stock.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: Leftovers can be refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 4 days. Reheat gently on the stovetop or in the microwave.",
